1)What is a web service?
It is a software system designed to support Machine to Machine interaction over a network.
It should not be platform independent

2)What makes web service platform independent?
The request and response make it platform independent via json(or)xml

+-------------+         HTTP Request         +----------------+
|             |----------------------------->|                |
|   Consumer  |                              |  Web Service   |
|  (Client)   |         JSON/XML             |    (Server)    |
|             |<-----------------------------|                |
+-------------+         HTTP Response        +----------------+

       |                                         |
   Any platform                              Any platform
 (Java, Python, etc.)                 (Java, .NET, Node.js, etc.)

3)Types of web services?
*SOAP - request and response are xml
*REST - request and response are json